{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit Plan b is a fast, unforgiving roguelite arcade game where each run drops you into a procedurally generated maze that will not wait for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level throws you into a new maze, unique to your run. Once you step inside, you must adapt and move with purpose. Mistakes matter. Your objective is simple: collect enough points to spawn the exit and escape. Surviving long enough to do that is the real challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills are powerful, but they aren't free. Activating them costs gems. Spend too much, and you might escape weaker than you entered. Play it safe, and you might not escape at all. Every decision is a tradeoff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit Plan b is built around tight movement, instant restarts, and escalating runs where survival pushes deeper and longer the better you play. Go in blind, fail fast, and chase that one perfect run where everything clicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally Generated Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level generates a new maze, keeping runs unpredictable and forcing constant adaptation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, Focused Stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single levels are quick to complete, chaining together into longer, high-stakes runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk\u2013Reward Skill System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful abilities cost gems earned during the run. Spend aggressively or save for survival. Every choice matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Arcade Flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight movement, fast pacing, and instant restarts keep the focus on skill and mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating Difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure builds as runs go deeper, rewarding precision, learning, and smart decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rookie Bomberman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863920/721def1ba90f4770a2dc7e0ed921f265dd9e601d.jpg"},{"name":" Seasoned Bomberman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863920/dd463cae57337714a511632319ce9ffba6fbb8a6.jpg"},{"name":"Bomberman Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863920/cb0a40eec925c8106a4bbd0f5b0e53ac5766a898.jpg"},{"name":"Portal-Free","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863920/fa4846eb2187cdbb52c8c03e5dffb245105018e9.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond the Goal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863920/25be5834e4a019e88489e267320d7a6f33735b64.jpg"},{"name":"Boost Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863920/382f4b6a1294d0f133882ac2e5bbddfb2d84d7a5.jpg"},{"name":"Ancient Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863920/93a141dcc9c62fe39b6663ae4362554a5cea2135.jpg"},{"name":"Boss Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863920/99c7528aa7f00b2d35d9172c9d98aced963cb3ca.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Trained","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863920/def64771d19f7810c73639d18c3eb799fffb49a5.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock the Cast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863920/016118376fd17d820e6d8eb26ed18a9538d3b26f.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863920?t=1770913158","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863920?t